OL,5,G1655 John & Lisa's Weekend Kitchen
OL,6,     FJohn Torode and Lisa Faulkner
OL,7,     Finvite us into their kitchen for a
OL,8,     Fmorning of feel good food.
OL,9,G1755 Judi Love's Culinary Cruise
OL,10,     FSet sail with comedian, presenter
OL,11,     Fand Masterchef winner Judi Love as
OL,12,     Fshe cruises around the
OL,13,     FMediterranean, visiting fabulous
OL,14,     Flocations and cooking up local
OL,15,     Fdishes along the way.
OL,16,G1855 Sport Stories: Oisin McConville
OL,17,     FGrowing up in The Troubles in
OL,18,     Fsouth Armagh, Oisin McConville
OL,19,     Fbecame a local legend as he
OL,20,     Frecovered from a missed penalty to
OL,21,     Fscore the winning goal in their
OL,22,     Fonly All-Ireland win.
